{"id":"msg_m_ex_crust_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_crust","label":"Crust · Nikke"},"label":"3. Mr. Gourmand.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_crust_02","next":null,"speakers":{"crust":"Crust"},"icons":{"crust":"si_c521_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_1","text":"Mr. Gourmand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_2","text":"Would you like a dessert as well?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_3","text":"It couldn't hurt.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_4","text":"Hehe, in that case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_5","text":"I'll prepare some cookies, nuts, potato chips...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_6","text":"Ooh, how about instant noodles?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_7","text":"You also eat instant noodles?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_8","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_9","text":"When I'm alone,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_10","text":"I eat instant noodles on occasion.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_11","text":"I thought chefs always ate fancy meals, even when they were alone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_12","text":"No way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_13","text":"That'd be very impractical.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_14","text":"I love cooking,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_15","text":"but there are times when you're at home and simply don't feel like it, you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_16","text":"Very true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_17","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_18","text":"whenever I'm alone,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_19","text":"I try and keep it simple.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_20","text":"How simple?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_21","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_22","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_23","text":"let's take the instant noodles for example.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_24","text":"First, I boil the water.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_25","text":"Right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_26","text":"Then I set the table.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_27","text":"I presume that includes the trivet?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_28","text":"I use separate bowls,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_29","text":"so there's no need for a trivet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_30","text":"I do like to lay out a tablecloth","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_31","text":"and matching utensils, though.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_32","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_33","text":"I also whip up some quick side dishes to go with the noodles.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_34","text":"Ooh, and while I'm at it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_35","text":"I chop up some green onions and chilies.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_36","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_37","text":"Oh boy, all this talk about food has got me feeling hungry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_38","text":"Just a second, Crust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_39","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_40","text":"I don't think you can call that simple.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_41","text":"Oh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_42","text":"Most people would simply eat the noodles straight out of the pot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_43","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_43","text":"There is no response from Crust for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_44","text":"Hey.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_45","text":"Mr. Gourmand?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_46","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_46","text":"Yes?","jump":"m_ex_crust_03_48"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_47","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_47","text":"Have you come to a realization?","jump":"m_ex_crust_03_48"},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_48","text":"I just looked up some stuff online about how people eat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_49","text":"I didn't realize how... unusual my eating habits were.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_50","text":"You're a true chef from head to toe. That's why I like you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_51","text":"Okay, but I honestly do try not to be too fancy with my meals!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_52","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_53","text":"Fine, forget it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_54","text":"I'm too hungry to keep talking about this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_55","text":"Let me show you how to make some genuine instant noodles!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_56","text":"Should I boil the water?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_crust_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_crust_03_57","text":"Yes, please!","jump":null}],"chat":true}